gantt
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  section Clicks
  Link task :cl1, 2024-01-01, 3d
  Invoke task :cl2, after cl1, 3d
  Both :cl3, after cl2, 2d
  Plain :cl4, after cl3, 2d
  click cl1 href "https://example.com/a?b=c"
  click cl2 call myFunc("x", 2)
  click cl3 call other() href "javascript:alert(1)"
  click cl1,cl4 href "HTTP://Example.COM/path with space"
  click missing href "https://nowhere.example"
